  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。ポテトを　メインにした　サラダ。パンとの相性は　かなりのもの。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛이 강한 식재료. 감자를 메인으로 만든 샐러드. 빵과는 궁합이 상당히 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味強勁的食材。以馬鈴薯為主的沙拉。和麵包極為搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût acide. Cette salade composée principalement de pommes de terre se marie merveilleusement bien avec le pain.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bei dieser sehr sauren Zutat handelt es sich um Salat auf Kartoffelbasis, der sich ziemlich gut mit Brot kombinieren lässt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El fuerte sabor ácido de esta ensalada con la patata como elemento principal es el acompañamiento perfecto para el pan.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto aspro. Questa insalata a base di patate si sposa benissimo con il pane.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This very tart ingredient—a soft salad that’s all about potatoes—pairs tremendously well with bread.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。ポテトを　メインにした　サラダ。パンとの相性は　かなりのもの。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味强烈的食材。以土豆为主的沙拉。与面包的搭配程度不容小觑。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
